    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=734 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/d6a2c23d2ce34d0ad5215c13bb2d9883.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six players place bets, make decisions, and take risks \u2014 all at the same time. Welcome to the table, where your life is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/bb2756dd99313ac2acbefbbaa4473049.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t wait for your turn \u2014 load the bullets, play your cards, manipulate your opponents, and stay alive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/f94b8ad6cc33613be4ba540216c3d8b3.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to choose whom to trust and support \u2014 and whom to betray and sacrifice. All for the sake of making your bet count, because every debt must be paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/c7c3f69dabda98337a45adfb001ce472.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot could be your last, but even with a gun pointed at you, you still have a chance to turn the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/fe411fbad48335ad4e9c9691151ebdf0.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\u200d\ud83d\udde8<i>Add To Whishlist Now. Coming Out Soon</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=734 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/51f261a8544f03d6d903cc93d3e2ba87.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/d6a2c23d2ce34d0ad5215c13bb2d9883.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six players place bets, make decisions, and take risks \u2014 all at the same time. Welcome to the table, where your life is on the line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/59c431297cd7efb280411b823a119fa5.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/bb2756dd99313ac2acbefbbaa4473049.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t wait for your turn \u2014 load the bullets, play your cards, manipulate your opponents, and stay alive at any cost.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/38ba6c0e13983ed299394abafe593eda.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/f94b8ad6cc33613be4ba540216c3d8b3.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll have to choose whom to trust and support \u2014 and whom to betray and sacrifice. All for the sake of making your bet count, because every debt must be paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.poster.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.webm?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/886ee46c8d83db89da7d5cac1ce75986.mp4?t=1752014806\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/c7c3f69dabda98337a45adfb001ce472.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot could be your last, but even with a gun pointed at you, you still have a chance to turn the odds in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612300/extras/fe411fbad48335ad4e9c9691151ebdf0.avif?t=1752014806\" width=800 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc41\u200d\ud83d\udde8<i>Add To Whishlist Now. Coming Out Soon</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
